        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI CHICAGO, Modern Satin Nickel Chicago Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Nickel Chicago Lever is very easy to install. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors that are between 1-1/4 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Modern Satin Nickel Chicago Lever with Round Rose is just that, modern. It is sleek and stylish where may contemporary levers are not.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Chicago Lever in Satin Nickel:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid metal lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Chicago Leverset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.98\" (126.4mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 0.55\" (13.9mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.06\" (52.4mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.36\" (59.9mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 0.39\" (10mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-Chicago-specifications.pdf?v=1691093347\"><b>AHI Chicago Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door lever on one side of the door. Visible surface mounting screws. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li></li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Visible surface mounting screws on interior and exterior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Privacy pin on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Satin Nickel Chicago Lever",
                "description": "The Satin Nickel Chicago Lever is stupid easy to install. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors that are between 1-1/4 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Modern Satin Nickel Chicago Lever with Round Rose is just that, modern. It is sleek and stylish where may contemporary levers are not.",
